	<Property Name="NI.Lib.Description" Type="Str">A sequence run is a time-bound logical container for a set of step runs.
Sequence runs are globaly unique by their SequenceRunId property.
SequenceRunType defines a sequence run when it is executed in the context of a process and an operation.</Property>
